# 2. 创建测试应用

## Deployment

创建 nginx Deployment：

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment

metadata:
  name: nginx-demo

spec:
  replicas: 2

  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx-demo

  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx-demo

    spec:
      containers:
      - name: nginx
        image: nginx
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
```

部署：

```bash
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
```

检查：

```bash
kubectl get pods -o wide
```

---

# 3. 创建 Service

service.yaml:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service

metadata:
  name: nginx-demo-service

spec:
  selector:
    app: nginx-demo

  ports:
  - port: 80
    targetPort: 80
```

部署：

```bash
kubectl apply -f service.yaml
```

检查：

```bash
kubectl get svc
```

查看 Endpoint：

```bash
kubectl get endpoints nginx-demo-service
```

结果：

```text
nginx-demo-service

10.244.x.x:80
10.244.x.x:80
```

说明 Service 已正确关联 Pod。

---

# 4. 创建 Ingress 规则

ingress.yaml:

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress

metadata:
  name: nginx-demo-ingress

spec:

  ingressClassName: nginx

  rules:

  - host: nginx.test.com

    http:

      paths:

      - path: /

        pathType: Prefix

        backend:

          service:

            name: nginx-demo-service

            port:

              number: 80
```

应用：

```bash
kubectl apply -f ingress.yaml
```

查看：

```bash
kubectl get ingress
```

